  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Energy is, $\\mathrm{E}=\\frac{\\mathrm{hc}}{\\lambda}$\n$\\mathrm{E}=\\frac{1242 \\mathrm{~nm}-\\mathrm{eV}}{\\lambda} \\Rightarrow \\lambda=\\frac{1242}{6}=207 \\mathrm{~nm}$",
    "image": null
